---
import SecondaryOutline from "../buttons/SecondaryOutline.astro";
---

<section id="strategy">
  <h2 class="text-heading-2 mb-8">Our Strategy</h2>
  <p class="text-body mb-32">
    Our approach to achieving our mission considers all the different areas that
    fusion research impacts. This means connecting the research, education and
    the everyone else together and using them to inform our strategy.
  </p>
  <div
    class="text-body flex flex-col items-center gap-10 text-center lg:mx-23 2xl:mx-30"
  >
    <h4 class="text-heading-4 text-center">Technology & Innovation</h4>
    <div class="flex flex-row gap-23">
      <div class="flex w-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-5">
        <SecondaryOutline> Learn by Building </SecondaryOutline>
        <p>
          Using machine design and construction as the central method for both
          learning and research
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex w-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-5">
        <SecondaryOutline> Iterate to innovate </SecondaryOutline>
        <p>
          Apply continuous feedback from experiments and prototypes to improve
          designs and processes.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-heading-2">+</div>
    <h4 class="text-heading-4 text-center">Education & Academia</h4>
    <div class="flex flex-row gap-23">
      <div class="flex w-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-5">
        <SecondaryOutline> Empower students </SecondaryOutline>
        <p>
          Give students ownership of technical organisational and leadership
          responsibilities, supported by mentorship.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class="flex w-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-5">
        <SecondaryOutline> Bridge research and industry </SecondaryOutline>
        <p>
          Integrate academic expertise with industry standards to ensure
          relevance, rigor, and career pathways.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="text-heading-2">+</div>
    <h4 class="text-heading-4 text-center">Public Engagement</h4>
    <div class="flex w-1/2 flex-col items-center gap-5">
      <SecondaryOutline> Communicate Fusion </SecondaryOutline>
      <p>
        Actively engage the public, partners, and policymakers to make fusion
        progress visible and inspiring
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
